  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- House of Tara Makeup and Business Skills Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">House of Tara Makeup school proposes a nine-week training for participants of this program. The Nine-week professional makeup training encompasses all the topics in the makeup school curriculum. With the skills acquired during training trainees will be able to set up their business in the makeup and fashion industry, work as freelance artists, in media houses, or advertising agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
